# Sentinel — configuration
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED to run Agent OS-native Sentinel. The supported Agent
# OS host (Claude Code, Codex, an IDE agent) owns the Binance MCP session and
# owns natural-language interpretation. Sentinel owns validation and the
# deterministic runtime.

# The one symbol Sentinel monitors. Frozen to ETHUSDC: the execution account's
# collateral is USDC (single-asset margin), so the tradeable contract is the
# USDC-margined ETHUSDC perpetual.
SENTINEL_SYMBOL=ETHUSDC

# Public Binance market data. Unauthenticated — used for the measurements the
# MCP toolset does not expose cleanly (klines, funding rate, open interest,
# scalar mark price). No key needed.
BINANCE_FUTURES_BASE_URL=https://fapi.binance.com

# --- State ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defaults are fine. All gitignored: the journal holds order intent and raw
# Binance responses.
# SENTINEL_GUARDIAN_STATE=.sentinel/guardian.json
# SENTINEL_RELAY_JOURNAL=.sentinel/relay/journal.jsonl
# SENTINEL_EVENT_LOG=.sentinel/events.jsonl

# --- OPTIONAL: dev-only Anthropic compile adapter ---------------------------
# NOT REQUIRED FOR AGENT OS-NATIVE SENTINEL.
#
# Guardians are authored by the HOST's LLM and handed to Sentinel as JSON:
#     npm run sentinel -- guardian:schema
#     npm run sentinel -- guardian:create --file guardian.json
#
# This key is only for compiling a Guardian from plain text OUTSIDE a host —
# a fixture or a local experiment (`npm run check:compiler`). Production
# Sentinel never reads it and never calls Anthropic.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- DEAD PATH: custom Binance MCP OAuth ------------------------------------
# Binance rejected Sentinel as a custom MCP OAuth client ("The AI Agent you are
# using is not currently supported"). The supported host owns the session; see
# spikes/custom-mcp-client/. These are kept only for that spike and are unused.
# BINANCE_MCP_URL=https://agent.binance.com/mcp/agentic
# SENTINEL_OAUTH_CLIENT_METADATA_URL=
# SENTINEL_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URL=http://localhost:8787/callback
#
# Execution sub-account keys for the LEGACY REST path, which is not the
# execution surface. Agent OS/MCP is. Unused in production.
# BINANCE_API_KEY=
# BINANCE_API_SECRET=
